<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Take time to behold Him,</l><l>The world rushes on;</l><l>Spend much time in secret</l><l>With Jesus alone.</l><l>By looking to Jesus</l><l>Like Him thou shalt be;</l><l>Thy friends, in thy conduct,</l><l>His likeness shall see.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Take time to behold Him,</l><l>Let Him be thy guide;</l><l>And run not before Him</l><l>Whatever betide;</l><l>In joy or in sorrow</l><l>Still follow thy Lord,</l><l>And, looking to Jesus,</l><l>Still trust in His Word.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Take time to behold Him,</l><l>Be calm in thy soul,</l><l>Each thought and each temper</l><l>Beneath His control.</l><l>Thus led by His Spirit</l><l>To fountains of love,</l><l>Thou then shalt be fitted</l><l>His mercy to prove.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
